WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.020
This might sound mean, but we need to start shaming toxic people at work.

00:04.020 --> 00:07.600
Because when your boss is micromanaging you,

00:07.760 --> 00:10.360
they make you think that you're bad at your job so that you'll work harder.

00:10.360 --> 00:13.780
When your coworker makes snippy, passive-aggressive comments in meetings,

00:13.780 --> 00:17.040
they know that you'll think that everyone's judging you and go quiet.

00:17.040 --> 00:20.700
They get away with it every time

00:20.700 --> 00:26.693
because they are shifting their shame onto you and making you think it's yours.
